{"2026.5.8:P02-Q13":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>光钨钴协同催化烯烃醛加成</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.8 · 麓山国际四月学情调研 · 原题13 · P02-Q13</div><h1>光钨钴协同催化烯烃醛加成</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学反应原理/化学反应速率/活化能/基元反应与反应历程</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：从循环确定总反应、键变化及同位素氘的转移。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学反应速率/影响化学反应速率的因素</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学反应速率/活化能</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构 化学键/化学键/共价键</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/认识有机物/有机反应类型</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构 化学键/原子的构成结构</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：<img src=\"chem-asset:bc0294b7930761d09bc9a04f693fad604dd3312150b6b8d5f47faef0bd351742:0;\" style=\"width:434.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>13. 武汉大学研究团队实现了光与十钨酸盐(<img src=\"chem-asset:1da9d5ddf7754bb95de617b03849daac504aadfc6bdc3075a31a65d046eb6e1f:1;\" style=\"width:42.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">)、<img src=\"chem-asset:edb43daff05b358b74d1396cb9b405f8e560d67920ef559152c6190fa54127bd:2;\" style=\"width:42.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">协同催化的芳香烯烃与醛的加成反应，反应机理如图所示。</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:1de350c0973704ce73dd52edb3de1327945c3ed370460beab2afc2ffcea88ab3:3;\" style=\"width:466.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>下列说法错误的是</p><p>A. <img src=\"chem-asset:edb43daff05b358b74d1396cb9b405f8e560d67920ef559152c6190fa54127bd:2;\" style=\"width:42.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">能增加活化分子百分数</p><p>B. 该机理中有非极性键的断裂和生成</p><p>C. 总反应方程式为：<img src=\"chem-asset:cb1a1c9a35c83384b9a07734fc3011e09f187b7772d53928adbb50d47a52b6c4:4;\" style=\"width:458.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D. 如反应物改为<img src=\"chem-asset:0e225b0b643ba2d2e29fb29dc003983ae31bc6e790f536a2739b52c11920975d:5;\" style=\"width:110.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，则产物为<img src=\"chem-asset:1bde28aeb09bfa41ca8a28ceeac6ea75aa001491d1b08bb12a655e54f4e71c24:6;\" style=\"width:183.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】D</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．<img src=\"chem-asset:5c45cc6bd00e6e32a8471d85f90e75fb19dfc9b61c481263d5bad1eaf70d2cc7:7;\" style=\"width:42.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">作为催化剂，能降低反应活化能，增加活化分子百分数，A正确；</p><p>B．该机理中存在非极性键断裂(如烯烃的<img src=\"chem-asset:81a7eb52adb15b844944bcc8d65e227ce08091a229476068e4258eaa63c040ab:8;\" style=\"width:41.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">双键)，生成的<img src=\"chem-asset:95fcaf43678517f494ecb11b1a8914ab8edbedd3e3d1ac030549a7ba5e661919:9;\" style=\"width:31.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">单键为非极性键，B正确；</p><p>C．根据机理图，反应物为苯甲醛(<img src=\"chem-asset:bbfeefde9d33eaf90d67cf79e27505fd68c494fae27274decf1fab7d1c0c91f3:10;\" style=\"width:56.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">)和苯乙烯(<img src=\"chem-asset:7ac74741019255b724123dd2b337b36d24c00703cff2292998057e8841228437:11;\" style=\"width:87.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">)，产物为<img src=\"chem-asset:167918e94673b0f5dfde5ff98a360f1c404dc11ed44d2b69f044dcd1e772f5cb:12;\" style=\"width:162.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，催化剂不参与总反应，总反应方程式为：<img src=\"chem-asset:cb1a1c9a35c83384b9a07734fc3011e09f187b7772d53928adbb50d47a52b6c4:4;\" style=\"width:354.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，C正确；</p><p>D．若反应物为<img src=\"chem-asset:0e225b0b643ba2d2e29fb29dc003983ae31bc6e790f536a2739b52c11920975d:5;\" style=\"width:118.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"chem-asset:c08689693fee067e4434d41626b7a494edf9cc388c1b94efa02cd3111f8abdc3:13;\" style=\"width:70.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">(醛基H被D取代)，醛的<img src=\"chem-asset:1d9c46853abd3ec5f1148a635f06cd1dc0e4fa9b67accb901ec8aed316af685f:14;\" style=\"width:41.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">键断裂后，D转移到烯烃加成后的碳上，产物应为<img src=\"chem-asset:4ce8d1334aa116e597278f9cea6fa9d4c1a0782459998c69eaa330aebc64db92:15;\" style=\"width:229.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，D错误；</p><p>故选D。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.8\\精品解析：湖南长沙麓山国际实验学校2026届下学期高三4月学情检测 化学试卷\\精品解析：湖南长沙麓山国际实验学校2026届下学期高三4月学情检测 化学试卷（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.8/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E9%BA%93%E5%B1%B1%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%894%E6%9C%88%E5%AD%A6%E6%83%85%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E9%BA%93%E5%B1%B1%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%894%E6%9C%88%E5%AD%A6%E6%83%85%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["0e225b0b643ba2d2e29fb29dc003983ae31bc6e790f536a2739b52c11920975d","167918e94673b0f5dfde5ff98a360f1c404dc11ed44d2b69f044dcd1e772f5cb","1bde28aeb09bfa41ca8a28ceeac6ea75aa001491d1b08bb12a655e54f4e71c24","1d9c46853abd3ec5f1148a635f06cd1dc0e4fa9b67accb901ec8aed316af685f","1da9d5ddf7754bb95de617b03849daac504aadfc6bdc3075a31a65d046eb6e1f","1de350c0973704ce73dd52edb3de1327945c3ed370460beab2afc2ffcea88ab3","4ce8d1334aa116e597278f9cea6fa9d4c1a0782459998c69eaa330aebc64db92","5c45cc6bd00e6e32a8471d85f90e75fb19dfc9b61c481263d5bad1eaf70d2cc7","7ac74741019255